# Kiddy Link — Cursor Rules

## Project
- Monorepo: mobile/ (Flutter) + backend/ (NestJS)
- Arabic RTL mobile app only — no web admin panel
- Single kindergarten — not multi-tenant
- Code in English, explain to user in Arabic

## Stack
- Flutter 3.x, NestJS, MySQL 8 + Prisma, Redis, MinIO, Docker Compose

## Strict Rules
- **No static business content** — all lists/labels/content from API/DB (see `.cursor/rules/dynamic-interactive.mdc`)
- **No silent buttons** — every control must navigate or call API; no placeholders or empty `onTap`
- **Fully interactive** — loading, empty, error, and success states on every screen
- **Mentor mode** — explain every change simply in Arabic, test before next step (see `.cursor/rules/programmer-mentor.mdc`)
- AI role: **assistant programmer + trainer** for the project owner
- No self-registration — admin creates all accounts
- Admin UI inside Flutter app only
- Stickers from DB (sticker_levels + stickers) — never hardcoded
- OpenAI called from backend only — never from Flutter
- Chat: parent ↔ teacher only
- Photos: teacher uploads to album (admin approval) | parent uploads in chat only
- Soft delete via is_active / is_deleted — no hard delete for sensitive records
- Validate inputs: DTOs (backend) + FormKey (Flutter)
- JWT: Access 15min + Refresh 7 days, bcrypt passwords
- Commits: Conventional Commits (feat:, fix:, chore:)

## Out of Scope
Payment, subscriptions, accounting, web panel, SMS, WhatsApp, QR attendance,
multi-kindergarten, English UI, self-registration, teacher-admin chat

